---
/*
 * This section is the answer to "don't sell it as AI" (SPEC.md §2.1).
 * It is not a workaround — the brand book itself says stories are
 * "written by locals" and the mission is "locally-sourced audio storytelling".
 * Never describe the technology here. Describe the people.
 *
 * Images are deliberately non-identifying (hands, notebook, back view) rather
 * than a posed face captioned as a real contributor — see ASSETS.md's warning
 * on IMG-02/03. Swap for real, credited photos once real writers are on board.
 */
---

<section class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20" id="locals">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div class="reveal order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <img
            src="/media/local-writer-1.webp"
            alt="Hands writing in a notebook at an outdoor café table, coffee beside a scatter of papers"
            width="900"
            height="1200"
            loading="lazy"
            class="aspect-[3/4] w-full rounded-[1.75rem] object-cover shadow-lg"
          />
          <img
            src="/media/local-writer-2.webp"
            alt="A resident seen from behind, waving to a neighbour on a quiet lantern-lit street at dusk"
            width="900"
            height="1200"
            loading="lazy"
            class="mt-8 aspect-[3/4] w-full rounded-[1.75rem] object-cover shadow-lg"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal order-1 lg:order-2">
        <p class="chip mb-6 bg-sand/60 text-espresso">Who tells you</p>

        <h2 class="display-lg text-espresso">
          Stories from people<br />
          <span class="text-terracotta">who live there.</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-7 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-espresso/75">
          <p>
            Every story is written by someone who lives in the city. Not
            rewritten guidebook copy. Not the same five facts you'd get from a
            search result.
          </p>
          <p>
            The person who tells you about the bar on the corner has probably
            been thrown out of it. That's the difference, and you can hear it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <blockquote
          class="mt-9 rounded-[1.75rem] bg-sand/35 p-7 ring-1 ring-inset ring-espresso/10"
        >
          <p class="font-display text-xl font-bold leading-snug text-espresso">
            "More like a walking podcast than a guided tour."
          </p>
          <footer class="mt-3 text-sm text-espresso/55">
            How we describe Curio to ourselves
          </footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
